    <widget class="StringMapEditor" name="layouts_editor">
     <property name="toolTip">
      <string>Where a record of each type lives under the root: a path template, with / between levels, or * to keep the record's current name at the root's top (a record already under the root stays where it is). The type * stands for every type not named. A type with no row, and no * row, cannot be moved here.</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
